[00:14.44] There I stood in the night
[00:16.58] Out on the broken pier
[00:19.22] Me with my feet in the sea
[00:22.08] You with your face in the clouds
[00:26.84] The man in the moon
[00:32.22] And as I heard your voice
[00:37.18] Felt your laugh
[00:41.08] Flood across the broken pier
